{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01531","headline":"琴曲歌辞 猗兰操 · 韩愈","name":"琴曲歌辞 猗兰操","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兰之猗猗，扬扬其香。\n不采而佩，於兰何伤。\n今天之旋，其曷爲然。\n我行四方，以日以年。\n雪霜贸贸，荠麦之茂。\n子如不伤，我不尔觏。\n荠麦之茂，荠麦之有。\n君子之伤，君子之守。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01531.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01531","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}